  "question": {
    "text": "A $20 \\mathrm{cm}$ long capillary tube is dipped vertically in water and the liquid rises upto $10 \\mathrm{cm} .$ If the entire system is kept is a freely falling platform, the length of the water column in the tube will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6UOu9",
      "text": "$5 \\mathrm{cm}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
