  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The height raised by liquid in capillary tube\r\n$$\r\nh=\\frac{2 I \\cos \\theta}{\\rho g h}\r\n$$\r\nAs in freely falling platform, a body experience weightlessness.\r\n\r\nSo, the liquid will rise upto to length of the capillary.\r\ni.e. height raised by the liquid will be $20 \\mathrm{cm}$.",
